==Battleground==
*Infinite [[Squire Rel]]s spawn after 6.67 seconds<sup>200f</sup>, delay 13.33~20 seconds<sup>400f~600f</sup>.
*10 [[Doge Dark]]s spawn after 10 seconds<sup>300f</sup>, delay 26.67~33.33 seconds<sup>800f~1,000f</sup>.
*3 [[Mistress Celeboodle]]s spawn after 16.67 seconds<sup>500f</sup>, delay 40~46.67 seconds<sup>1,200f~1,400f</sup>.
*1 [[Sunny Celeboodle]] spawns as the boss after 40 seconds<sup>1,200f</sup>.
*1 [[Bearkini]] spawns after 53.33 seconds<sup>1,600f</sup>.
*3 [[Scissoroo]]s spawn after 60 seconds<sup>1,800f</sup>, delay 53.33~60 seconds<sup>1,600f~1,800f</sup>.

==Strategy==
It's not particularly hard to rush this stage. Cats like [[Ancient Egg: N101 (Rare Cat)|Courier Cat]] and [[Crazed Cow Cat (Super Rare Cat)|Crazed Lion Cat]] completely invalidate it before any of the hard enemies can even spawn. Good meatshielding from [[Tank Cat (Normal Cat)|Eraser Cat]] and [[Crazed Tank Cat (Super Rare Cat)|Crazed Wall Cat]] act as good support. [[Bahamut Cat (Special Cat)|Crazed Bahamut Cat]] is a good counter against the sunny celeboodle if you are unable to rush, while the scissoroos can be countered with [[Surfer Cat (Super Rare Cat)|Castaway Cat]] or basically any anti-Alien.

